# 防止凭证意外进仓库
wb_token.txt
*.token
*token*.txt
.env
.env.*
# 本机自动化日志不进仓库；但 GitHub Actions 的运行记录要提交（可远程查看）
logs/*
!logs/actions/
logs/actions/*
!logs/actions/last-run.txt
!logs/diag/
logs/diag/*
!logs/diag/last-diag.txt
!logs/probe/
logs/probe/*
!logs/probe/last-claim-probe.txt
# runner 上的临时输出文件
run-output.txt
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
